ed one meal; no replenishment benefit has been demonstrated.\\\"},{\\\"id\\\":\\\"food-preservation\\\",\\\"status\\\":\\\"active\\\",\\\"question\\\":\\\"Can a small, feasible preservation process extend the usefulness of gathered safe food?\\\",\\\"evidence\\\":[\\\"Five gathered roots remain owned at tick 10.\\\",\\\"Inventory records ageing of the gathered root stack.\\\",\\\"Roots and berries have known starting food-safety facts.\\\"],\\\"uncertainty\\\":\\\"Preservation methods, requirements, costs, safety, and achievable storage improvement are unknown.\\\",\\\"goal\\\":\\\"Obtain a feasible trial specification and compare actual preservation outcomes before scaling up.\\\",\\\"completedSteps\\\":[],\\\"outputs\\\":[],\\\"missing\\\":\\\"A defined learnable process, its costs, and direct trial evidence.\\\",\\\"next\\\":\\\"Request a concrete preservation interface and evaluate its requirements.\\\",\\\"pauseReason\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"benefit\\\":\\\"No preservation benefit has yet been observed.\\\"}]}\"}","logprobs":[]}

